applet/src/main/java/io/github/bobodread876/fedimintcard/applet/SchnorrHW.java is copied
whole from cashucard/javacard (applet 3.1). Changed: the package line, the curve names (this
package keeps them in Secp256k1.java) and one marked block of this package's helpers at the
end. The tear harness in applet/src/test (TearHook.java, TearLoader.java) is ported from the
same repository's tests. Its licence follows verbatim.

In FedimintCardApplet.java, applet 3.0's block-header clock (SET_HEADER, targetOf,
timesFour, the floor), its burn-then-answer order for SIGN and its attestation follow
cashucard/cashucard's applet (CashuApplet.java, protocol 2.2); the clock code is ported
from it. Same licence.

The PIN wait, the PIN-given rule, CHANGE_PIN, the anchor and the weak-header rule in
FedimintCardApplet.java follow the same applet (protocol 3.1) and the tests ported from it:
CashuTestSupport.java (copied unchanged), and ChangePinTearTest, FarHeaderTest, FirstAnchorTest,
PinWaitTest and WeakClockTest (adapted), all in applet/src/test. Opener.java and applet/build.xml
follow cashucard/javacard. registry/src/auth.ts, backup.ts and managerKeys.ts follow the shape of
cashucard's ops. Same licence.

The sealed PIN in FedimintCardApplet.java (GET_NONCE, unseal, sealBlock, unblockPin, and
requireFullPoint with its field code: isSquareModP, powModP, reduceModP and their helpers) is
ported from the same applet (Cashu Card 1.9, its unseal, sealBlock, unblockPin and
processGetPinKey), and SealedPinTest in applet/src/test ports its sealed-PIN tests. Same licence.
The field powers over p itself padded to 64 bytes (rsaCubeP, rsaRootP, rsaEulerP, fieldP,
fieldPInit, powRaw and powModP's choice between the two paths) are ported from the same applet
(Cashu Card 3.1), and FieldPaddedKeysTest in applet/src/test ports its FieldReductionTest and
the field tests of its ChipEnginesTest. Same licence.

tools/cardkit is ported from cashucard's tools/cardkit. Its own NOTICE, in
that directory, names what was copied and carries the same licence.

